WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Welcome to the Local AI Workshop. Today we set up a small language model right on your laptop.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:01.000
First step is downloading Ollama from the website, one install command and done.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:04:11.000
Now we pull a model. The pull command grabs a few gigabytes, so stretch your legs while it runs.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:05:29.000
With a model loaded we call it through simple HTTP requests from local scripts.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:07:04.000
You can tune a model with a short modelfile without sending data anywhere.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:24.000
Privacy is the point: your words never leave this machine.
